# Any room: a fresh first night, seated at the best table the room has (or none). Placement, the spotlight finding
# the table and the magician rising, up to his first request. Used for the four-room montage.
seat 0 32
sleep 1
eval Parlor.NightStore.ResetAll(); Parlor.ParlorApp.Instance.Replace(); return "replaced";
sleep 4
until 20 placed: tier
sleep 1
hand right open @rest
hand left open @restL
until 40 gate arrival.hands →
sleep 3
eval return Parlor.DebugSeat.Stats();
